# cc-debian12 ships OpenSSL 3.0.x, which the vendor marks not affected.
# Advisory: https://openssl-library.org/news/secadv/20260813.txt
CVE-2026-14456

# OpenSSL DTLS handshake retransmission heap disclosure / DoS.
# Distroless cc-debian12 ships bookworm libssl3 3.0.x; Debian has no
# bookworm fix yet (OpenSSL 3.0 public fixes ended; premium-only 3.0.23).
# EdgeQuake API serves HTTPS/TLS over TCP — no DTLS listener.
# Track until bookworm DSA or runtime moves to distroless/cc-debian13.
# Advisory: https://openssl-library.org/news/secadv/20260929.txt
# Tracker: https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-84782
CVE-2026-84782
